7. ⚠️ Common Mistakes
❌ Mistake	✅ Fix
Tuning learning_rate and n_estimators separately	Fix the rate, early-stop for trees, lower the rate at the end
Early stopping on the test set	Use a validation split
Using default max_depth blindly	Tune depth or leaves first
Trusting raw predict_proba	Check the reliability curve and calibrate
Unequal tuning effort between models	Same CV and same trial budget
Skipping the logistic regression baseline	Always benchmark simple first
Using accuracy on imbalanced data	Use PR-AUC, recall, or F-beta
SMOTE before the train/validation split	SMOTE only inside the training fold
is_unbalance and scale_pos_weight together	Use only one
